["rect",160,0,960,720,9227974,100],
["text","Control",600,45,22.5,0],
["text","Running a level",232,83,16.5,0],
["text","When the game starts a map of under water kingdom appears on your screen with one or more paths. It shows the",196,112,16.5,0],
["text","already solved levels (golden beads), levels that are being solved (pulsating blue beads) and as yet unentered levels",196,134,16.5,0],
["text","(empty sockets).",196,156,16.5,0],
["text","It is only possible to solve the levels one by one. It means that you cannot enter any level behind the blinking",232,184,16.5,0],
["text","bead. Only when you solve it the next bead starts pulsating and so on.",196,206,16.5,0],
["text","Pulsating level can be run by left-clicking the bead. If you left-click an already solved level, statistics – the",232,234,16.5,0],
["text","number of moves – of your solution appears. You have two options now: solve it again (click the brain icon) or",196,256,16.5,0],
["text","watch the solution (eye icon).",196,278,16.5,0],
["text","Control panel",232,315,16.5,0],
["text","After running the leve the control panel appears. It shows which fish is currently active and how to control it.",196,344,16.5,0],
["text","Besides that you can use the control panel to save or load the game and abort or restart th current level.",196,366,16.5,0],
["text","When saving the solution you must keep in mind that there is only one slot for load and save for each level.",232,394,16.5,0],
["text","When saving new position the older one is erased without asking for confirmation. It is recommended that you save",196,416,16.5,0],
["text","new position only when you are sure that you are going in the right direction.",196,438,16.5,0],
["text","Different options are on the second page of the control panel. You can control the volume of sound, speech and",232,466,16.5,0],
["text","F/X, you can choose the language of subtitles or turn them off altogether.",196,488,16.5,0],
